  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Health Basket Fund Program (Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A total of eight donor countries/organizations, including KOICA, Canada, Denmark, Switzerland, Ireland, World Bank, UNICEF, and UNPFA, are participating in the  Basket Funding  with the support of  the Ministry of Health and local governments in Tanzania. The fund works mainly for improving and strengthening the quality of health and medical care.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen health systems and support the primary healthcare services nationwide(except Zanzibar) in TanzaniaHBF(HSSP) &#xc218;&#xd589;&#xc5d0; &#xb530;&#xb978; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc2dc;&#xc124;, &#xc778;&#xb825;, &#xae30;&#xc790;&#xc7ac;/&#xc57d;&#xd488; &#xacf5;&#xae09; &#xc99d;&#xac00;, &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc81c;&#xb3c4;, &#xd504;&#xb85c;&#xadf8;&#xb7a8;, &#xc870;&#xce58;, KOICA&#xc758; HBF &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xacbd;&#xd5d8; &#xcd95;&#xc801;</narrative>
